"""A fixed corpus of statements written from the SQLite documentation.

Each entry is (setup statements, query, ordered). The corpus targets the places an
engine written from the documentation is most likely to differ from the C code:
numeric edge cases, text/number coercion, printf, dates, JSON, windows, errors.
The random generator (gen.py) covers breadth; this file is the part a person can
read in one sitting and check against the docs.
"""

